  "task": "We're upgrading the signaling system on Metro Line 7 next month, which will cause multi-day closures. I need you to help justify the project by analyzing recent reliability metrics and current passenger volumes, secure budget approval and sign the contractor agreement, and manage passenger communications during the closure through alerts, alternative routes, notifications, and refunds for monthly pass holders."
